www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falbums%2Fthe-recovery-process-reimagined.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 828w, https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falbums%2Fthe-recovery-process-reimagined.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 1080w, https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falbums%2Fthe-recovery-process-reimagined.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 1200w, https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falbums%2Fthe-recovery-process-reimagined.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 1920w, https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falbums%2Fthe-recovery-process-reimagined.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 2048w, https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falbums%2Fthe-recovery-process-reimagined.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 3840w\" src=\"https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falbums%2Fthe-recovery-process-reimagined.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW\"></p></div><div><p>2003<!-- --> to <!-- -->2026</p><h3>The Recovery Process</h3><p>Original album archive, then <!-- -->Reimagined Edition<!-- -->.</p></div></article></div></div><div id=\"archive\" data-reveal=\"true\"><p>Archive</p><h2>The Old Site Is Part Of The Art.</h2><p>A curated entry point for shows, recording photos, videos, flyers, and recovered artifacts, with the original 2001 site preserved as part of the experience.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.fadingmaize.com/archive\">Open Full Archive</a></p></div><div data-reveal=\"true\"><div><p>Timeline</p><h2>From Dorm Room To Launch Plan.</h2></div><ol><li><time>2000</time><div><p><strong>Charlie and Brad start Fading Maize</strong></p><p>The acoustic college-band idea begins before Jacob arrives at Ripon.</p></div></li><li><time>2001</time><div><p><strong>Jacob joins at Ripon College</strong></p><p>Charlie finds Jacob on campus and asks him to join on drums and backing vocals.</p></div></li><li><time>2002</time><div><p><strong>Dorm-room recordings and Wisconsin shows</strong></p><p>The band records in Charlie's room and plays around Ripon, Oshkosh, and Wisconsin.</p></div></li><li><time>2025</time><div><p><strong>The old site comes back online</strong></p><p>Jacob buys fadingmaize.com back and relaunches the 2001 site in October 2025.</p></div></li><li><time>2026</time><div><p><strong>The Reimagined Editions arrive</strong></p><p>All three original albums return to streaming beside their full 2026 AI-assisted revivals.</p></div></li></ol></div><div id=\"people\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div><div><p>The people</p><h2>The Humans Stay In The Credits.</h2></div><p>Fading Maize was real before the revival tools existed. The archive, the authorship, and the 2026 work are presented as connected history without blurring who is actively shaping what.</p></div><div aria-label=\"Fading Maize member biographies\"><article data-status=\"active-revival\"><p><img alt=\"Charlie (Chuck) Saponara\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 540px) calc(100vw - 56px), (max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 56px), (max-width: 1180px) 30vw, 350px\" srcset=\"https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FChuckBioPic1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 256w, https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FChuckBioPic1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 384w, https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FChuckBioPic1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 640w, https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FChuckBioPic1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC4zQn61L8cPgQvW 750w, https://www.fadingmaize.com/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FChuckBioPic1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_9b6FjLF282skuC