ive</strong><span>Original-era show footage, dorm-room recordings, and photo sets as they are cleaned up.</span></p><p><strong>Direct-to-fan extras</strong><span>Bandcamp bonus material and merch experiments as the audience grows.</span></p><a href=\"https://www.fadingmaize.com/revival\">Understand The 2026 Revival</a></div></div></div></div>",
